From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>
Date: Wed, 25 Aug 2021 00:56:34 +0200
Subject: adds around screen capturer

This patch adds a new entire screen capturer implementation that is based on CGWindowListCreateImageFromArray to capture the display every frame, thus providing perfect exclusion of around windows.

